Bambu Studio is an open-source, cutting-edge, feature-rich slicing
software for 3D printers, tailored for Bambu Lab machines.

This SlackBuild repacks the official release AppImage into a native
Slackware package installed under /opt/bambu-studio with desktop
integration and USB udev rules.

Download the official AppImage from:
https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio/releases
